# Normalise line endings in the repository, and pin the files whose behaviour
# depends on them.
* text=auto

# Shell scripts must be LF whatever the checkout. A Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise get CRLF, and bash fails to parse a
# CRLF script and exits 2. For .claude/hooks/require-worklog-plan.sh that is
# not a cosmetic problem: a PreToolUse exit 2 blocks the tool call, so every
# Write and Edit would be denied, including the work-log edit that is the
# documented way out.
*.sh text eol=lf
